<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="a75cd6ac">&lt;p&gt;
    Key responsibilities include:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Collaborate with stakeholders to define strategies and plans for the test effort as well as lead, guide and monitor
        test design, implementation, traceability and execution
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Perform resource planning and estimatation for the test effort
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Collaborate with appropriate stakeholders to procure and ready a test environment
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Schedule test execution as well as measure, monitor and report test progress, solution quality and test results
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
